  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A civil society organisation will be selected through a call for proposals, to deliver against the &quot;Prioritise&quot; Pillar of the Humanitarian Strategic Framework, under the HEP programme. The aim will be to enable better evidence based prioritisation of international humanitarian system response resources.</narrative>
  </description>
